# Supabase connection — copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your values.
# Find both values in the Supabase dashboard: Project Settings → API.
#
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL      → "Project URL"        e.g. https://abcdefgh.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY → "anon public" or "publishable" key
#
# `.env.local` is git-ignored, so your keys are never committed.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the app.

